<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP REFRAINS FROM REVERSE REPO OPERATION.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP REFRAINS FROM REVERSE REPO OPERATION.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>refrained from staging a reverse repo operation on Friday, the</p>
<p>bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
